<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="Michael Anticoli is reconnecting with his network and exploring meaningful opportunities across strategy, creativity, AI, hospitality, writing, product thinking, and consulting." />
  <meta property="og:title" content="Hey friends — it’s been a while." />
  <meta property="og:description" content="A note from Michael Anticoli about reconnecting, rebuilding, and finding the next meaningful opportunity." />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <title>Hey friends — Michael Anticoli</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f4efe7;
      --paper: #fffaf3;
      --ink: #201d1a;
      --muted: #6f665f;
      --line: rgba(32,29,26,.12);
      --accent: #8b5e3c;
      --shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(73,50,34,.12);
      --radius: 28px;
      --max: 1120px;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      color: var(--ink);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 10%, rgba(255,255,255,.78), transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 20%, rgba(193,146,103,.14), transparent 30%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #f7f2eb 0%, #eee6dc 100%);
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }
    a { color: inherit; }
    .page-shell {
      width: min(calc(100% - 32px), var(--max));
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 32px 0 72px;
    }
    .topbar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
      padding: 10px 4px 28px;
      font-size: .78rem;
      letter-spacing: .12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .mark { font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }
    .location { text-align: right; }
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      min-height: 76vh;
      display: grid;
      align-items: end;
      padding: clamp(34px,7vw,84px);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 36px;
      background: linear-gradient(150deg, rgba(255,255,255,.96), rgba(249,241,231,.9));
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    .hero::before, .hero::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      border-radius: 999px;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .hero::before {
      width: 420px; height: 420px; right: -170px; top: -190px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(139,94,60,.18);
    }
    .hero::after {
      width: 240px; height: 240px; right: 50px; top: 30px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(139,94,60,.1);
    }
    .eyebrow {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: .78rem;
      letter-spacing: .16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    h1, h2, .pullquote, .signature { font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
    h1 {
      max-width: 780px;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(3.4rem,10vw,7.8rem);
      line-height: .92;
      letter-spacing: -.055em;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .hero-copy {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 28px 0 0;
      font-size: clamp(1.08rem,2.2vw,1.45rem);
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .hero-note {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 34px;
      padding-top: 22px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      font-size: .92rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .hero-note::before { content: ""; width: 34px; height: 1px; background: var(--accent); }
    .section {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(180px,.72fr) minmax(0,1.7fr);
      gap: clamp(32px,7vw,100px);
      padding: clamp(78px,10vw,132px) clamp(6px,2vw,24px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .section-label {
      position: sticky;
      top: 24px;
      align-self: start;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: .76rem;
      letter-spacing: .16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .section-content { max-width: 760px; }
    h2 {
      margin: 0 0 28px;
      font-size: clamp(2.3rem,5vw,4.7rem);
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -.04em;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    p { margin: 0 0 1.15em; font-size: clamp(1.03rem,1.4vw,1.18rem); }
    .lead { font-size: clamp(1.25rem,2vw,1.7rem); line-height: 1.5; }
    .rhythm {
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.55rem,3.2vw,2.6rem);
      line-height: 1.18;
    }
    .opportunity-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 28px;
    }
    .opportunity {
      padding: 18px 20px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.42);
      font-size: .98rem;
    }
    .pullquote {
      margin: 48px 0;
      padding: 34px 0 34px 28px;
      border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
      font-size: clamp(1.85rem,4vw,3.5rem);
      line-height: 1.08;
      letter-spacing: -.035em;
    }
    .statement-list { display: grid; gap: 16px; margin-top: 36px; }
    .statement {
      padding: 22px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      font-size: clamp(1.25rem,2.4vw,2rem);
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    }
    .cta-panel {
      margin-top: 72px;
      padding: clamp(34px,7vw,68px);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: #211d19;
      color: #fffaf4;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    .cta-panel h2 { max-width: 760px; }
    .cta-panel p { max-width: 720px; color: rgba(255,250,244,.72); }
    .button-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 34px;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-flex;
      min-height: 58px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: #fffaf4;
      text-decoration: none;
      text-align: center;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: transform 180ms ease, background 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease;
    }
    .button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.34);
    }
    .button.primary { background: #fffaf4; color: #211d19; border-color: #fffaf4; }
    .button.quiet { opacity: .72; font-size: .9rem; }
    .signature-wrap { padding: 70px 8px 10px; }
    .signature {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(2.3rem,6vw,5rem);
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -.045em;
    }
    .signature-sub { margin-top: 12px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .95rem; }
    footer {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
      padding: 48px 4px 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .82rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 780px) {
      .page-shell { width: min(calc(100% - 20px), var(--max)); padding-top: 14px; }
      .topbar { padding-inline: 8px; }
      .hero { min-height: 72vh; padding: 32px 24px; }
      .section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; padding: 74px 14px; }
      .section-label { position: static; }
      .opportunity-grid, .button-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      footer { flex-direction: column; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="page-shell">
    <div class="topbar">
      <div class="mark">Michael Anticoli</div>
      <div class="location">Los Angeles · Open to meaningful work</div>
    </div>

    <section class="hero">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">A note to my community</p>
        <h1>Hey friends.<br>It’s been a while.</h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">
          I’ve spent the last couple of years heads-down rebuilding my life.
          Somewhere in that process, I realized that many of the people I care about
          have no idea what I’m working on—or that I’m looking for my next opportunity.
          So I’m reaching out.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-note">This is about reconnection, not rescue.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <p class="section-label">01 · Where I’ve been</p>
      <div class="section-content">
        <h2>Quiet doesn’t always mean gone.</h2>
        <p class="lead">For the past couple of years I’ve been unusually quiet—not because I disappeared, but because life became complicated.</p>
        <p>Some of you know pieces of the story. Some of you know none of it.</p>
        <p>In that time I’ve navigated layoffs, identity theft, health challenges, a legal battle with my bank, going back to school, building new creative projects, and trying to reinvent my career from the ground up.</p>
        <p>Some days have been incredibly difficult.</p>
        <p>Some have been unexpectedly beautiful.</p>
        <p><strong>Through all of it, I’ve kept building.</strong></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <p class="section-label">02 · Why now</p>
      <div class="section-content">
        <h2>Because people can’t open a door they don’t know I’m standing near.</h2>
        <p class="lead">Many of the people I’ve met over the last fifteen years probably have no idea I’m looking for work.</p>
        <div class="rhythm">
          <span>If we’ve worked together…</span>
          <span>shared drinks…</span>
          <span>made music…</span>
          <span>built brands…</span>
          <span>talked philosophy…</span>
          <span>or simply crossed paths…</span>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top:30px;">I’d genuinely love to reconnect.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <p class="section-label">03 · What I’m looking for</p>
      <div class="section-content">
        <h2>I’m open.</h2>
        <p>If it’s interesting and involves thoughtful people solving meaningful problems, I want to hear about it.</p>
        <div class="opportunity-grid">
          <div class="opportunity">Brand strategy</div>
          <div class="opportunity">Creative strategy</div>
          <div class="opportunity">AI & creative technology</div>
          <div class="opportunity">Product thinking</div>
          <div class="opportunity">Writing & content</div>
          <div class="opportunity">Hospitality & operations</div>
          <div class="opportunity">Consulting & freelance</div>
          <div class="opportunity">Contract or full-time</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <p class="section-label">04 · What I actually do</p>
      <div class="section-content">
        <h2>My career has never fit neatly inside one box.</h2>
        <p>I’ve spent years creating brands, designing customer experiences, producing music, writing, studying astrology and symbolism, exploring AI, and building products that connect seemingly unrelated disciplines.</p>
        <div class="pullquote">People usually hire me because I notice patterns others overlook.</div>
        <div class="statement-list">
          <div class="statement">I help ideas become clearer.</div>
          <div class="statement">Systems become simpler.</div>
          <div class="statement">Experiences become more meaningful.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <p class="section-label">05 · The ask</p>
      <div class="section-content">
        <h2>If someone comes to mind…</h2>
        <p class="lead">I’d be incredibly grateful for an introduction.</p>
        <p>Not because I’m asking for charity.</p>
        <p>Because opportunities almost always begin with conversations.</p>
        <div class="rhythm">
          <span>One introduction.</span>
          <span>One recommendation.</span>
          <span>One person saying,</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pullquote">“You should meet Michael.”</div>
        <p>That can completely change someone’s trajectory.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <p class="section-label">06 · Or simply say hello</p>
      <div class="section-content">
        <h2>And if you simply want to catch up…</h2>
        <p class="lead">I’d love that too.</p>
        <p>It’s been too long.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-panel">
      <p class="eyebrow">Let’s reconnect</p>
      <h2>Open a door. Start a conversation. Pass my name along.</h2>
      <p>Replace any placeholder destinations below with your final URLs before publishing.</p>
      <div class="button-grid">
        <a class="button primary" href="Michael-Anticoli-Resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Resume</a>
        <a class="button" href="https://michaelanticoli.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Portfolio</a>
        <a class="button" href="https://www.linkedin.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
        <a class="button" href="https://moontuner.xyz" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MOONtuner</a>
        <a class="button" href="mailto:michaelanticoli@gmail.com">Email Me</a>
        <a class="button quiet" href="https://buymeacoffee.com/michaelantq" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buy Me a Coffee</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="signature-wrap">
      <p class="signature">With gratitude,<br>Michael Anticoli</p>
      <p class="signature-sub">Strategist · Writer · Composer · Creative Technologist</p>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <span>© 2026 Michael Anticoli</span>
      <span>Built for reconnection, not rescue.</span>
    </footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
